  <History Date="02-07-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (poor documentation.  dual modes are vague.  control rationship to elements is not clear.  assumed ring pattern spd fade fwd is 128-191 not 128-127 as per charts.  pattern selection ranges not documented properly and don't make sense.  no pixel layout)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="16-09-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Cameo OTOS W3 (documentation suffers from all of the same problems as W3)" Version="16" />
  <History Date="18-09-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="23" />
  <History Date="13-11-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Cameo OTOS W12 (documentation suffers from all of the same problems as the W3 and W12)" Version="24" />
  <History Date="15-11-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="28" />
  <History Date="08-12-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised with pixel layout for beam elements.  Ring layout information is unavailable." Version="29" />
  <History Date="21-01-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised pixel layout including ring elements in response to customer feedback." Version="30" />
